source: crates/marion-supervisor/src/home/tests.rs
expression: screen
---
 marion  keys
  agents                                 input line
  j/k      move                          tab      next agent type
  enter    attach (pane); ^] d back      ↑↓       the type's models
  enter    full output (headless)        enter    run, send or add
  n        new task                      esc      close it
  s        steer a running agent
  x        cancel, asks; again kills     setup
  u        resume an ended agent         enter    a harness's detail and fix
  o        shell in its workspace        r        re-check
  d        what its branch changed       e        edit agent types
  m        merge its branch, asks        n        new agent type, previewed
  pgup/dn  scroll output; end follows    a        add a key, or a login
  ,        setup                         u        use a login
  ?        this page                     x        remove key or login, asks
  q        quit                          esc      back







 esc back  j/k scroll
